Recorded fixtures for tests (no network in unit tests):

  sse/                 recorded provider SSE streams, replayed at several
                       chunk sizes by src/testing/fixture_tests.zig:
                         completion_text.sse   plain streamed completion
                         tool_call.sse         streamed tool call + arguments
  local_testing.json   the deterministic `local/testing` model used by
                       `zig build fake-model` and the e2e fake provider

Wanted but not yet recorded (docs/TESTING.md lists the same set): mid-stream
disconnect, malformed tool-call JSON, 429 + Retry-After, usage-only tail, and
events split across chunk boundaries mid-escape / mid-UTF-8. There is no
ndjson/ golden-transcript tree; protocol behavior is covered by proto.zig
round-trip tests and the e2e scenarios.

Record real OpenRouter streams with:
  curl -N https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions ... | tee fixture.sse
then scrub anything sensitive before committing.
